# prd_step — PRD lane step

The lane's only administrative surface. `next` answers the next concrete step (checklist item, owed gates, inbox); `gate` runs one declared gate; `discover` records a plan-affecting finding; `ask` raises a decision and frees the turn; `done` finishes the lane (gates verified, work committed, pushed, stamped). When unsure: action "next". Finished: "done".

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  /** next | gate | discover | ask | done | stage | note | amend */
  action: "next" | "status" | "gate" | "discover" | "ask" | "done" | "stage" | "note" | "amend";
  /** for action=gate */
  gate_id?: string;
  /** for action=discover | note */
  text?: string;
  /** for action=stage — the stage number */
  stage?: number;
  /** for action=stage — done (default) | split; for action=amend — list (default) | accept | defer */
  sub?: "done" | "split" | "list" | "accept" | "defer";
  /** for action=amend accept|defer — the amendment # */
  amend_n?: number;
  /** for action=note — decision (default) | failed */
  kind?: "decision" | "failed";
  /** for action=discover */
  affects?: "lane" | "sprint" | "prd";
  /** for action=ask */
  question?: string;
  /** for action=ask */
  options?: string[];
  /** for action=ask — index into options */
  recommend?: number;
  /** for action=done */
  notes?: string;
  /** for action=next — append a checklist item */
  add?: string;
  /** for action=next — tick a checklist item id */
  check?: string;
  /** for action=gate — bound the gate run */
  timeout_ms?: number;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://prd_step.

